  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Financiamiento de Soluciones Sostenibles de Transporte Elctrico</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Financing Sustainable Electric Transport Solutions</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general del programa es reducir el consumo del combustible fsil y la emisin de Gas de Efecto Invernadero en Per a travs del promocin de soluciones de movilidad de bajas en carbono. El objetivo especfico es estimular y demostrar la viabilidad financiera de inversiones privadas en Vehculos Elctricos (VE).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of the program is to reduce fossil fuel consumption and Greenhouse Gas (GHG) emissions through the promotion of low-carbon mobility solutions in Peru. The specific objective is to stimulate and demonstrate the financial viability of private investments in Electric Vehicles (EV).</narrative>
  </description>
